SUMMARY:the Park at Flat Rock\; A Walk 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**A WALK IN THE PARK**\nThis Week: The Park
  at Flat Rock\\*\\*.\\*\\*\n**Description:**\nthe 66-acre park has a flat\
 , open green space and a 1.3 mile trail (shortcuts available) that you can
  walk or run.\nhttps://flatrockparkfoundation.org/the-park/\nDifficulty: E
 asy\, peasy\nSuitable for beginners? Yes\nWe are the Sloth Walking Team: 
 “We will get there when we get there.”\n**Up to 12 ppl** are welcome t
 o join us.\n**https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bsh_8qxUfDY**\nLength: <1.5 
 mi\; Total ascent: 25 ft\nApprx return time: 11 AM\nOptional: Some will wa
 lk 2 laps…\n**Optional:** Lunch @ TBD. (Treskas??)\n**This is a dog-part
 icipant walk.** This event is NOT for those who are uncomfortable with the
  antics of fun-loving dogs. Dogs are welcome (IF their masters are well tr
 ained). 'On leash' rules apply.\nWeather Check: Hendersonville\, NC\nAll w
 alks are at your own risk. You are responsible for your OWN safety and ade
 quate equipment.\nWaiver: There are certain risks inherent in any outdoor 
 activity. Each participant\, by signing up to attend this event\, agrees t
 o release from liability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Friends\, its Partners\
 , Affiliates\, and members for any accident\, injury\, illness\, or person
 al loss which might occur while participating in this activity or while tr
 aveling in any vehicle during this trip. Each participant further agrees t
 o abide by the rules and regulations concerning safety\, to follow instruc
 tions of the leader(s)\, and not to become intentionally separated from th
 e group. The leader(s) also has the right to use any images collected on t
 his trip for recording on website photo collections.\ngordie's contact: Cu
 rmudgeonHiker@gmail.com\n(**before** day of hike): 828.393.0297 (text only
 )\n**Pics: https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums**
